## Module 6: Reporting & Audit Module

Developed a fully integrated, interactive Reporting & Audit dashboard (Screen ID `7514e431603942a5a46ce2d77719ee58`):

### 1. Interactive Top Filter Panel
- Integrated selectors for **Department**, **Expense Category**, and **Employee** (populated dynamically via the database using `useGetUsersQuery`).
- Added a **Date Range** indicator that dynamically computes calendar ranges based on selected time frames (Last 30 Days, Quarterly, YTD).
