## Module 7: AI Assistant Module

Developed the full-stack suite of features and high-fidelity layouts for the **AI Assistant Hub** matching Stitch Screen ID `d95c80a8e7bc4a0f869e38207cddf725`:

### 1. Database-driven Backend Integrations
- **AI Service Enhancements**: Modified [ai.service.ts](file:///d:/vibe%20code/spend-managment/project/backend/src/modules/ai/ai.service.ts) to:
  - Implement `getAnomalies(employeeId?, departmentId?)` querying real Mongoose DB expenses to surface off-hours claims, amount outliers, and duplicate claims.
  - Implement `getForecast()` aggregating approved database transactions into actual vs. projected spend metrics and calculating potential Q4 savings.
  - Implement `getConfig()` / `updateConfig(payload)` to retrieve and dynamically save toggle states and sensitivity thresholds.
  - Implement `getSystemLogs()` tracking automated categorization events, policy flags, and conversions.
- **Session Continuity**: Leveraged [RedisService](file:///d:/vibe%20code/spend-managment/project/backend/src/database/redis.service.ts) in `ai.service.ts` to cache and restore chatbot conversation logs under `ai:session:${sessionId}` for contextual policy Q&A replies.
- **Route Definitions**: Added the endpoints (`/anomalies`, `/forecast`, `/config`, and `/logs`) in [ai.controller.ts](file:///d:/vibe%20code/spend-managment/project/backend/src/modules/ai/ai.controller.ts) bound with RBAC and JWT guards.

### 2. Frontend Bindings & High-Fidelity UI Redesign
- **Endpoint Registrations**: Added RTK Query hooks in [api.ts](file:///d:/vibe%20code/spend-managment/project/frontend/src/services/api.ts) for anomalies, forecasts, configurations, and logs.
- **AI Assistant Chatbot Layout**: Redesigned [AiTab.tsx](file:///d:/vibe%20code/spend-managment/project/frontend/src/features/ai/AiTab.tsx) displaying online status indicator, bot thinking bubble, and inline citation blocks for policy references.
- **Interactive Widgets**:
  - **Spend Forecast chart**: Renders an SVG chart of Jul–Dec spend, styling historical columns alongside projected columns with a glowing "Now" indicator line.
  - **AI Engine Config panel**: Interactive toggle switches and sensitivity range slider that automatically submit updates to the backend in real-time.
  - **Anomalies overview list**: Risk indicators (Risk: 94/100, 68/100, etc.) with custom hover glows.
  - **System Intelligence Log table**: Table representing recent automated categorization, violation flags, and conversion tasks with corresponding confidence values.

